    slug: "how-to-choose-a-safe-link-building-service",
    title: "How to Choose a Safe Link Building Service",
    category: "Link Building",
    excerpt: "Practical questions, red flags, and pilot advice for choosing a link building service without buying mystery spam inventory.",
